OL,3,GNEWSAMuslim convert used 'lads'        
OL,4,Aholiday' chat to join IS               
OL,6,FHe used chat groups named "Lads'       
OL,7,FHoliday" and "AirBnB Buddies" before   
OL,8,Fbooking a flight, quitting his job, and
OL,9,Fwriting a "goodbye letter".            
